{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">觀塘翠屏北邨發生火警，一名男童逃至窗外冷氣機頂求援，獲救後送院。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">網上片段中看到該名13歲男童，蹲在外牆冷氣機頂暫避一段時間。消防之後成功進入單位，並協助他返回屋內，清醒送院。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.KT-2130_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026k7uailnc6K1791383807.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.FIRE.KT-2130_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">警方晚上近8時接獲多人報案，指翠屏北邨翠桃樓一個單位冒出大量濃煙，兼傳出爆炸聲。消防到場約半小時內將火救熄。期間有約70人自行疏散。警方指，涉事單位內一個外置充電器起火，起火原因無可疑。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T15:21:06.643730+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}